# Disk writes (W13-S03): the kernel overwrites the end of a blank scratch disk
# (kargs disktest=hdb). W19-S01: hdc is an ext2 volume mke2fs made, at /mnt;
# a file, a symbolic link to it and a hard link to it read the same.
wait burrow>
type cat /mnt/hello.txt
key ret
type cat /mnt/link.txt
key ret
type cat /mnt/docs/hard.txt
key ret
type poweroff
key ret
